    "project": "research/semaev_general_split_audit_20261113/lean",
    "theorem": "SemaevGeneralSplitAudit.actual_all_source_splits_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_all_source_splits_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (m n : ℕ), (leftLastFactor W m n).natDegree=2^(m+1) ∧ (rightLastFactor W m n).natDegree=2^(n+1) ∧ Polynomial.resultant (leftLastFactor W m n) (rightLastFactor W m n) (leftLastFactor W m n).natDegree (rightLastFactor W m n).natDegree= MvPolynomial.rename (arityCast ((m+2)+(n+2)) (blockArityProof m n)) (canonicalMv W (((m+2)+(n+2))-3))) ∧ (∀ N k : ℕ,4≤N → 1≤k → k≤N-3 → ∃ m n : ℕ,N=(m+2)+(n+2) ∧ k=n+1) ∧ (∀ (K S : Type) [Field K] [CommRing S] [IsDomain S] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (f : K →+* S) (xs ys : List S) (hx : 2≤xs.length) (hy : 2≤ys.length), Polynomial.resultant (listKernel W f xs hx) (listKernel W f ys hy) (kernelSize xs) (kernelSize ys)=joinedValue W f xs ys hx hy) ∧ (leftNatural controlP controlQ controlR 1≠rightNatural controlP controlQ controlR 1 ∧ leftFixed controlP controlQ controlR 1 1=rightFixed controlP controlQ controlR 1 1) ∧ s4Ring (0 : ℚ) 0 0 1 0 1 2 3 ≠ s4Ring (0 : ℚ) 0 0 1 0 2 1 3 ∧ ¬ ∃ W : WeierstrassCurve ℚ,W.b₂=0 ∧ W.b₄=0 ∧ W.b₆=0 ∧ W.b₈=1",
    "decl_sha256": "62189b29ec246a78c9593dc275e1038d8c5e770627fbc6e269f98511c44089a1",
    "scope": "All fields and actual general Weierstrass coefficient models, all m,n>=0 and source total arity N=(m+2)+(n+2): actual literal source polynomials with elimination variable last have proved exact natural degrees2^(m+1)/2^(n+1), and their natural-dimension resultant equals the actual canonical MVpolynomial at arity N via explicit Fin cast. Every original permitted N>=4,1<=k<=N-3 covered with k=n+1. All domain specializations under arbitrary coefficient maps retain prescribed block dimensions and allow repeated coordinates/degree drops. Fully prescribed Fubini, actual S3 transfer, actual canonical recurrence/full symmetry, tuple/list bridges, universal MV evaluation and injective independent-variable coefficient maps are proved, not assumptions. Separate exact general natural-degree-reset resultant counterexample and independent-b S4 failure plus proof those b values cannot be a curve. Confirms qualified source recursion, no source refutation/novelty. Higher-arity absolute irreducibility and other all14 obligations remain open; no new group interpretation for singular coefficient models or new native experiment.",
